      },
      "message": "Add `exports.browser.require`\n\nThis will allow tools like Jest \u2013 when used in conjunction with `jest-environment-jsdom` \u2013 to grab the CommonJS variant of the package when looking for the browser entry point.\n\nThis will make whitelisting blurhash in Jest's [`transformIgnorePatterns`](https://jestjs.io/docs/configuration#transformignorepatterns-arraystring) redundant.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "9792edde762cfb32854c52695bfa306b1583288e",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/woltapp/blurhash/git/trees/9792edde762cfb32854c52695bfa306b1583288e"
      },
